+    // The PS interface tile carries one tile-level enable, and prjuray sets it
+    // from the pips that pass through: fuzzers/070-ps8-int/dump_features.tcl
+    // writes OUTPUTS_ENABLED.1 for any INT_INTF_LEFT_TERM_PSS tile in which a
